爱卿回来了，一路上辛苦了。”坐在龙椅上的皇帝李寻十分热情地道。“臣，不辛苦，不过臣的孙女可就…”冷擎天故意留半句，好让人浮想联翩，脸上还带着心痛、心疼的表情。皇帝一看到冷擎天的这个表情，就忍不住在心里边咒骂，这个老狐狸可是不好对付啊，预儿这次可是惹大麻烦了，看来这次预儿是想不娶都不行了。“爱卿啊！”“陛下，臣请陛下为臣孙女主持公道。”“爱卿啊，朕已经罚了预儿了，至于徐家小姐…她毕竟不是我东池国之人，朕就算是想惩罚她，替若雪出气，也没有办法啊，你是二朝元老了，可要体谅朕的难处啊，不过朕已经通知了徐家把人接回去，好好管教，朕相信徐家小姐以后决不敢在犯了，而且徐家也愿意补偿若雪受到的伤害，你就当是给小辈一次机会，不要计较了吧！”皇帝好言好语地劝说道，徐家他不想得罪，可是东池国的重臣他也不能得罪了，他可是很倚重冷擎天的，东池国更是不能没了这个战神，他现在只希望冷擎天能给他这个皇帝一个面子，不要太计较了。“若雪受了这么重的伤，我差点就见不到这个孙女了，不知道陛下打算怎样补偿微臣。”冷擎天锐利的双眸眯了眯道，他早就想到了陛下会这样说，所以他本来也没打算现在就要了他们的命，就像雪儿说的，想报仇以后有得是机会，没必要非得现在就杀了他们，现在并不是好时机，还是多要点补偿实际点。这个老狐狸连他也要打劫，皇帝李寻心里这个气啊，可是面上还得带着笑意，不管怎么说，只要这个老狐狸肯不计较这件事了，出点血他也认了，大不了从徐家身上找回来就是了，谁让这事是他们徐家小姐惹出来的，哼！就算是五大世家之一又怎么样，还不是一样不敢惹这个疯子一样的爆龙，龙有逆鳞，这只老狐狸同样有逆鳞，碰不得啊！“爱卿放心，朕也会好好补偿若雪的。”李寻咬牙道。“那微臣就先谢过陛下了。”冷擎天笑眯眯地道，随后从储物戒指里掏出一张纸“陛下，雪儿受伤不轻，需要好好调养，可是微臣实在是囊中羞涩，您看这药材……”“需要什么药材尽管去御药局取。”李寻很大方地道，一点药材他还不放在眼里。“臣谢陛下，另外这是臣拟的赔偿清单，陛下和徐家照着上面写的赔偿就可以了，臣就不提其它的非份要求了。”冷擎天非常善解人意地道，把手里的清单递给太监。在一旁侍候的太监接过清单放到了皇帝的桌案上。李寻拿起清单，打开来，立时瞪大双眼，一口气没上来，差点噎过去，太监见状，连忙把水递上，皇帝喝了口水，这口气才顺过来，可是却差点气得吐血了，单子上的内容到是不多，一共才10几样，可是每一样都是无价之宝，甚至于有价无市，就拿那水晶蜂蜜来说吧，现在都已经炒到1000紫晶币一克了，可是单子上却写了10斤，这可真是狮子大开口啊，况且，他就是有钱也没地方买去啊！“陛下，单子上的东西你可以和徐家商量着来。”冷擎天提醒到，言外之意就是不用您一个人大出血。对啊，还有徐家呢，他怕什么，经冷擎天这么一提醒，皇帝马上就从惊吓中清醒了过来，心里也好受多了，唉，血还是得要出的，只是不用那么多了。“陛下，臣还有一事！”冷擎天接着道。“爱卿还有何事啊？”皇帝的声音都有些发抖了，他怕啊，怕冷擎天又整出什么妖蛾子。“陛下，七皇子天资卓越，德才兼备，若雪一直很仰慕七皇子，这次又因七皇子而遭受无妄之灾，实在是……”“爱卿啊！”“陛下，若雪实在是配不上七皇子，臣请陛下解除七皇子与若雪的婚约，臣祝七皇子与徐小姐有情人终成眷属。”冷擎天根本不给皇帝说话的机会，径直说完他要说地话。“……”皇帝愣了愣，他没听错吧，冷擎天说要解除婚约，这怎么行呢，虽然若雪是个傻子，可是这个婚约对预儿太重要了。“爱卿，这个婚是先皇赐的。”皇帝提醒他。“陛下，先皇赐婚的时候对微臣承诺过什么，陛下还记得吧！”冷擎天很认真地看着皇帝的眼睛道。“爱卿，你已经决定了？”皇帝很是无奈，他是不想解除这个婚约的，毕竟这个婚约对预儿可是有着无尽的好处的，可惜啊，预儿不理解。“臣决定了。”说完，冷擎天从储物戒指中拿出了订婚时的信物递给太监，皇帝看着手中的信物，示意太监去取另一个物归原主。“老祖宗”皇帝李寻在冷擎天离开后来到皇宫的一处偏殿，这里和金壁辉煌的皇宫比起来可以说是最不起眼的地方，可是这里却是整个皇宫的禁地，只因这里住着一个重要人物。正在伺弄花草的布衣老者抬起头，皱了皱眉，沧老的脸上明显带着不悦。“你来干什么，我不是说过没有重要的事情不要来打扰我吗？”老者训斥道，他对这些后辈子孙真是越来越失望，没一个像点样的。“老祖宗。”“出什么事了？”老者继续摆弄着他的花花草草。“冷擎天刚才进宫了。”皇上李寻脸色有些不自然。“然后呢？”“我按您交待的和他说了。”“那还有什么问题？”老者连头都懒得抬。“他提出解除婚约了。”皇帝小心翼翼地道。“你同意了？”老者抬起头，有些浑浊的双眼直直地看着李寻。“我没法不同意，父皇当初赐婚的时候就答应过他，只要对婚约不满意可以随时解除。”当初赐婚都是为了他能够坐稳皇位，只是权宜之计，冷擎天才答应的。“唉，罢了，罢了！”老者叹了叹气，继续弄他的花花草草去了。“陛下，冷大将军把御药房的药材库搬空了！”皇帝李寻刚回到寝宫，送冷擎天的太监就慌慌张张的跑了来。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/zhizunkuangqi/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 Robbery \"Miss, wake up.\" Lu Tao heard a slight noise on the bed and opened the pink bed curtain. The lady and the master chatted very late yesterday. She thought the lady would sleep more! \"Well, the weather is good today.\" Leng Ruoxue sat up from the bed and looked at the warm sunshine outside the window. \"Yes, the weather is nice today, and today is also our Valentine's Day in Dongchi Country. There are so many people on the street!\" Cuizhu's pretty little face, who walked in with a basin in his hand, was full of excitement. Leng Ruoxue got dressed and washed herself first, then asked Lu Tao to help her do a simple hair style. \"Valentine's Day?\" Unexpectedly, there is Valentine's Day in this other world. I don't know how it is different from her previous life. Leng Ruoxue is a little curious. \"Miss, this Valentine's Day has a history!\" Cuizhu said deliberately. \"Tell me about it!\" \"According to the historical records of our Dongchi Kingdom, today is the day when the founding emperor and empress of our Dongchi Kingdom fell in love. The founding emperor and his wife had a deep love for each other. In order to commemorate their relationship, today is designated as Dongchi Kingdom's Valentine's Day. It is also said that all men and women who fall in love today will be blessed by the founding emperor and empress.\" The innocent little girl said with a yearning look on her face. Leng Ruoxue nodded understandingly, \"Cuizhu is already an adult and is starting to miss spring.\" \"Miss, you are bullying me.\" Cuizhu's face turned red with shame and she looked at her unscrupulous lady with tears in her eyes. It might rain at any time. \"Grandpa, are you up?\" Leng Ruoxue looked at Lu Tao who had already laid out breakfast and asked. \"The master has already entered the palace.\" Leng Ruoxue did not expect that her grandpa would enter the palace so early. She knew it was all because of her. She was so touched to have such a grandpa who treated her like a princess and loved her unconditionally, and she felt so happy. \"Cui Zhu, sit down and eat.\" Leng Ruoxue saw that Lu Tao had already sat down, but the Cuizhu girl was still standing there, looking at her with extremely resentful eyes. She couldn't help but feel a little funny. She was such a simple child. \"Young lady will bully Cuizhu.\" Cuizhu muttered quietly, slowly walked to the dining table and sat down. \"Miss is teasing you!\" Lu Tao couldn't help laughing. Looking at Cuizhu's cute appearance, let alone the lady, she couldn't help but want to tease her. Why didn't she find Cuizhu so fun before? She looked at her young lady again. The young lady changed a lot after she woke up. Not only did she not allow them to kneel down easily, but she also asked them to eat at the same table. In the young lady's words, although you are my maids, you must also have a strong heart. Whether you want to be a humble servant forever or want to be a superior person is up to you. But I don't need servants who can only serve others. This is what the young lady has. Reversing the words made Lu Tao truly realize that the young lady is no longer the young lady that they had to worry about and take care of in everything. They can no longer regard the young lady as the stupid young lady who knew nothing before. The current young lady will become a strong person that everyone admires in the future. If they want to stay with the young lady, they must follow the young lady's footsteps, otherwise they will only get further and further away from the young lady, and she has decided to follow the young lady forever. \"Let's go for a walk after dinner.\" Leng Ruoxue said while drinking porridge. It had been a few days since she came to this world, and she still didn't know what it was like outside! Palace: \"General, please wait a moment, I will go and report.\" The eunuch leading the way bent down and said respectfully, let alone a little eunuch, even the emperor would not dare to mess with this man! Leng Qingtian nodded slightly, with no emotion or anger on his expressionless face. He had no intention of admiring the beautiful scenery of the imperial garden. He just wanted to settle the matter quickly so that he could go home to accompany his precious granddaughter. The scenery of the palace was beautiful, but it could not compare with his Xue'er. Besides, it was not his first time to come to the palace, and the beauty of the palace was not attractive to him. After a while, a eunuch led him into the emperor's study room. \"Your Majesty.\" Leng Qingtian bent slightly to show respect for His Majesty. \"Ai Qing is back. It's been a hard journey.\" Emperor Li Xun, who was sitting on the dragon throne, said enthusiastically. \"Chen, it's not hard, but my granddaughter is just...\" Leng Qingtian deliberately left half a sentence to make people think about it, with a heartbroken and distressed expression on his face. As soon as the emperor saw Leng Qingtian's expression, he couldn't help cursing in his heart. This old fox is not easy to deal with. Xu'er is in big trouble this time. It seems that this time Xu'er has no choice but to marry him. \"My dear sir!\" \"Your Majesty, I ask you to uphold justice for my granddaughter.\" \"My dear sir, I have already punished Yu'er. As for Miss Xu's family... she is not from my Dongchi country after all. Even if I want to punish her, There is nothing she can do to vent her anger on Ruoxue. You are a veteran of the Second Dynasty, so you must be considerate of my difficulties. However, I have already notified the Xu family to take him back and discipline him well. I believe that Miss Xu will never do anything like this in the future. If you dare to commit a crime, and the Xu family is willing to compensate Ruoxue for the harm, you just give me a chance and don't worry about it!\" The emperor persuaded the Xu family nicely, but he couldn't offend the important ministers of the Dongchi Kingdom. He relied heavily on Leng Qingtian, and the Dongchi Kingdom couldn't live without this god of war. Now he only hoped that Leng Qingtian could give him a face as the emperor, and don't care too much. \"Ruoxue was so seriously injured, I almost didn't see this granddaughter. I don't know how your majesty plans to compensate me.\" Leng Qingtian narrowed his sharp eyes and said. He had long thought that his majesty would say this, so he didn't plan to kill them now. As Xue'er said, if you want to take revenge, you will have a chance in the future, so there is no need to kill them now. Now is not a good time, so it is better to make more pragmatic compensations. This old fox wanted to rob even him. Emperor Li Xun was so angry, but he still had to keep a smile on his face.", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}